FulfillKYCTest
├── when the caller lacks CHAINLINK_DON_ROLE
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the user address is zero
│   └── it should revert with InvalidUser
├── when no KYC request exists for the user
│   └── it should revert with NoKYCRequest
├── when the KYC is already approved or rejected
│   └── it should revert with KYCAlreadyProcessed
└── when all validations pass
    ├── when the KYC is approved
    │   ├── it should update status to Approved
    │   ├── it should store the kycDataHash
    │   ├── it should set approvedAt timestamp
    │   ├── it should create OnchainID identity
    │   ├── it should increment totalKYCsApproved
    │   └── it should emit KYCFulfilled event with approved=true
    └── when the KYC is rejected
        ├── it should update status to Rejected
        ├── it should NOT create OnchainID identity
        ├── it should NOT increment totalKYCsApproved
        ├── it should set cooldown period
        └── it should emit KYCFulfilled event with approved=false

